  "details": "I'd like the ability to add my own icons to the HUD similar to the mic mute icon.  I want to be able to tie these custom icons to Avatar 3.0 expression parameters so that they could show the current state of parameters I've defined.\nI'd also like the option to make the gesture toggle state icon always visible.  I use gesture toggle often to lock my facial expressions and it's hard to remember whether I have it on or off when the icon always disappears.",
